<title>UK: Strong to very strong demand at London tea auction.</title>
<headline>Strong to very strong demand at London tea auction.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strong demand was seen at Monday's London tea auction, with prices generally five to 10 pence per kilo firmer for all categories, the official report said.</p>
<p>The offshore sector emerged as very strong, with gains of 10 to 20 pence.</p>
<p>The next auction will be held on Monday, July 28.</p>
<p>--Stephen Grainger +44 171 542 8074.</p>
</text>
